{
  "format_version": 2,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "chapter": "playground",
  "conversations": {
    "playground_arrival": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "pa_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "pa_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "这是一块空地。地上画着球场，旁边有攀爬架、长椅和一间小屋。你刚才进来的门就在身后。"
        },
        {
          "id": "pa_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "四周没人。也没有人管你该站哪儿。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_arrived",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_objective",
              "key": "objective.playground"
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "playground_arrived",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "你走到了小区后面的空地：一个两头有篮筐的球场、一间小屋、一张长椅、一个攀爬架。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "pa_3",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "小屋后面的栅栏缺了一块。缺口外面还是水泥地，和这边没什么两样。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "pg_shed": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "ps_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "ps_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "器材室有扇绿门，门上装着搭扣，还挂着一把锁。窗户里贴着一张表，纸面朝外。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你可以试试门，也可以看看窗户里的表。或者就算了。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "frame",
              "text": "照着门框试这扇门。",
              "next": "ps_boundary_check",
              "conditions": {
                "not_flags": [
                  "check:pg_shed:ps_boundary_check"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "count",
              "text": "读窗子里的那张表。",
              "next": "ps_ledger_check",
              "conditions": {
                "not_flags": [
                  "check:pg_shed:ps_ledger_check"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "leave",
              "text": "就让它锁着。",
              "next": "ps_leave"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_boundary_check",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "等一下。先看看门和门框之间的缝。",
          "check": {
            "ability": "orientation",
            "difficulty": 9,
            "kind": "visible",
            "success": "ps_boundary_ok",
            "failure": "ps_boundary_bad"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_boundary_ok",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "门不是被挤变形了。合页那边留着一道缝，从上到下差不多一样宽。原来卡在那里的东西像是被拆走了。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_shed_open",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_checked",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "pg_shed_open",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "器材室的门能被推进去：锁扣在空气里，搭扣没有钉住任何东西。"
            }
          ],
          "next": "ps_inside"
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_inside",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "椅子一直摞到天花板。旁边有卷绳子，还有三个坏掉的羽毛球。最上面那把椅子的椅面底下贴着一条胶带，上面写了个名字。坐在椅子上的人看不到。",
          "next": "ps_inside_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_inside_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "站在门口看不清那个名字。要看只能把椅子挪开，可这堆椅子摞得太高了。",
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_boundary_bad",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "门框看着没歪。暂时看不出问题。",
          "next": "ps_boundary_bad_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_boundary_bad_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "门推不动。门底下透着光，搭扣后面的漆却很干净，像是搭扣以前装在别处。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_shed_looked",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_checked",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "pg_shed_looked",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "器材室的门关不严。搭扣后面的漆是干净的，搭扣钉得歪。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_ledger_check",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "看看窗户里的那张表。尤其是它贴的位置。",
          "check": {
            "ability": "orientation",
            "difficulty": 8,
            "kind": "visible",
            "success": "ps_ledger_ok",
            "failure": "ps_ledger_bad"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_ledger_ok",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "一共九行，纸边和窗框对得很齐。最后两行写的是同一天，第二行的日期却比第一行晚了一周。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_rota_read",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_checked",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "pg_rota_read",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "器材室窗里的值日表把同一天列了两次，第二张的日期是下星期。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_ledger_bad",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "一张值日表。两边有线，中间留着空白。",
          "next": "ps_ledger_bad_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_ledger_bad_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你重新数了一遍，只有八行。雨水把其中两行泡在了一起。还有一个姓没糊掉，和巷口墙上粉笔写的那个姓一样。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_rota_smudged",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_checked",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "pg_rota_smudged",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "值日表被雨泡过。上面有一个姓，和巷口墙上的粉笔字一样。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "ps_leave",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你没碰那把锁。回头看了一眼，近处的篮筐没有网，远处那个倒是有。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "pg_ball": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "pb_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "pb_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "一个乒乓球卡在器材室的水泥基座和地面之间。后面的树篱底下露出一块发白的东西，扁扁的。"
        },
        {
          "id": "pb_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "缝隙比乒乓球还要深。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "reach",
              "text": "把手伸进缝里。",
              "next": "pb_boundary_check",
              "conditions": {
                "not_flags": [
                  "check:pg_ball:pb_boundary_check"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "shadow",
              "text": "拿影子去量。",
              "next": "pb_ledger_check",
              "conditions": {
                "not_flags": [
                  "check:pg_ball:pb_ledger_check"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "leave",
              "text": "不管它。",
              "next": "pb_leave"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "pb_boundary_check",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "先把手伸进去摸摸。我来帮你判断里面有多深。",
          "check": {
            "ability": "orientation",
            "difficulty": 9,
            "kind": "visible",
            "success": "pb_boundary_ok",
            "failure": "pb_boundary_bad"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "pb_boundary_ok",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "手伸进去一掌深，碰到水泥，又摸到一道边。球后面还有个小台面，上面放着什么东西，不是圆的。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_tag_found",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_checked",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "pg_tag_found",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "球后面、小屋底下的台面上，有一块扁金属牌，一头有个孔。"
            }
          ],
          "next": "pb_tag"
        },
        {
          "id": "pb_tag",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "金属牌一面冰凉空白。另一面压着四位数字，数字里的漆和小屋的门是同一种绿。",
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pb_boundary_bad",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "后面没东西。伸进去一掌深，就到底了。",
          "next": "pb_boundary_bad_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "pb_boundary_bad_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你擦破了指节。乒乓球动了一下，又卡回原处。树篱下那块白色的东西并不在球后面，而是在更外面——像是根棍子上蹭了一道白漆。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_ball_stuck",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_checked",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "pg_ball_stuck",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "球还卡着。小屋有两个基座，缝只在一边。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pb_ledger_check",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "先看影子吧。总比把手弄破强。",
          "check": {
            "ability": "orientation",
            "difficulty": 7,
            "kind": "visible",
            "success": "pb_ledger_ok",
            "failure": "pb_ledger_bad"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "pb_ledger_ok",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "影子比那道缝伸得更远。树篱下的东西离你更近，而且形状也不像球。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_shadow_measured",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_checked",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "pg_shadow_measured",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "树篱下那块发白的东西比卡住的球更靠前，所以它不是球的影子。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pb_ledger_bad",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "一道缝，一个球，再加一道影子。看起来都能对上。",
          "next": "pb_ledger_bad_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "pb_ledger_bad_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "数字是对得上的，可这也说明不了什么。球还是卡在原处。器材室下面有两个基座，只有左边留着缝。你偏偏在算错的时候注意到了这种事。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_ball_stuck",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_checked",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "pg_ball_balance_failed",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "算式对得上，什么也没说明。小屋有两个基座，缝只在左边那个。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "pb_leave",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你没去碰那个球。它又不是你的，也没人站在这里等着拿它。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
